# Every checkout, on every platform, gets the same bytes.
#
# Windows checkouts default to CRLF, which turns one root cause into two
# findings (the line endings, and every comment that grew a column) and can
# make a test compare a string it never wrote. The suite checks text, so the
# text is line-feed everywhere and the comparison is about content only.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary